WEBVTT

00:13:28.956 --> 00:13:32.108
you will see it as an idea worth spreading

00:13:32.108 --> 00:13:34.581
in order to help organizations be more effective,

00:13:34.581 --> 00:13:37.157
to help women create careers that soar,

00:13:37.157 --> 00:13:40.761
and to help close the gender gap at the top.

00:13:40.761 --> 00:13:42.584
Thank you.

00:13:42.584 --> 00:13:44.517
(Applause)